1
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:04,180
I'm still hanging here

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:08,000
Ten feet down

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,540
And you cut the line

4
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:40,460
I was holding to your silence

5
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:43,940
Like a prayer inside the dark

6
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:47,560
Every word you left unspoken

7
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:51,780
Carved its name across my heart

8
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,640
You said you couldn't lose me

9
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:57,780
Then vanished into smoke

10
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:05,080
Came back dressed in sorrow like I'd forget how much I broke

11
00:01:05,780 --> 00:01:08,900
I know this play by memory

12
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:12,920
Every curtain, every scene

13
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:16,440
But the mask is on the floor now

14
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:19,200
You were never what you seemed

15
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:22,900
Your story came too late

16
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:26,460
Too late to resurrect my faith

17
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:29,720
You had my heart beneath your blade

18
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:33,380
Now I'm gone, now I'm gone

19
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:36,920
Your sorry came too late

20
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:44,320
You asked me for distance

21
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:48,180
So I handed you the sky

22
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:51,320
But I won't be your shelter

23
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:55,300
When your heaven starts to die

24
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:58,260
I would have burned beside you

25
00:01:58,820 --> 00:02:01,540
Blood through every flame

26
00:02:01,540 --> 00:02:05,100
But love should not feel holy

27
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:08,440
When it only teaches pain

28
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:12,300
I needed you like breathing

29
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:16,000
But you stole the air away

30
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:19,460
Now I'm quiet as a graveyard

31
00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:22,440
And you still expect me to stay

32
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:26,020
Your story came too late

33
00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:29,360
Too late to open up the gate

34
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:32,600
You lost a soul you couldn't save

35
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:36,080
Now I'm free, now I'm free

36
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:39,700
Your story came too late

37
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:48,640
You called yourself an angel

38
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:51,840
But shadows crowned your head

39
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:58,780
I was blinded by the halo while your hands were painted red

40
00:02:58,780 --> 00:03:05,840
You pulled me close to cut me down, then begged me not to bleed

41
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:12,800
But wounds don't turn to roses just because you're on your knees

42
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:20,600
No sorry won't undo the burn, no prayer can make the ashes stern

43
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:24,000
I'm rising where you watch me break

44
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:27,680
I'm not the ghost you get to tell

45
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:31,480
Sorry won't save you, sorry won't cleanse you

46
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:34,400
Sorry won't raise what you buried alive

47
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:38,140
I was your ruin, I was your victim

48
00:03:38,140 --> 00:03:41,100
Now I'm the fire you cannot survive

49
00:03:44,980 --> 00:03:49,020
Your sorry came too late

50
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:52,200
Too late to resurrect my fate

51
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:55,660
You had my trust and watched it fade

52
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:59,120
Now I'm gone, now I'm gone

53
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:02,600
Your story came too late

54
00:04:03,180 --> 00:04:06,020
Too late to drag me back in chains

55
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:09,380
I leave your darkness with my name

56
00:04:09,860 --> 00:04:11,020
Now I'm free

57
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:14,660
Your story came too late

58
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:21,780
I was holding on your rope

59
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:24,380
But now

60
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:28,760
I let it fall

